Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake (>= 3.28), python3, patch
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://onnxruntime.ai
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libonnxruntime1
Architecture: amd64
Section: libs
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ONNX Runtime - inference engine for ONNX models (library)
 ONNX Runtime runs machine learning models in the ONNX format. This build
 has only the CPU execution provider; its dependencies (protobuf, onnx,
 abseil, re2, ...) are linked in statically.
 .
 It is for Ubuntu releases that have no onnxruntime package, for the
 speech modules of the linux-tts PPA.

Package: libonnxruntime-dev
Architecture: amd64
Section: libdevel
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libonnxruntime1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: ONNX Runtime - inference engine for ONNX models (headers)
 ONNX Runtime runs machine learning models in the ONNX format.
 .
 This package has the headers of the C and C++ API, libonnxruntime.pc and
 the CMake package configuration.
